    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1256">

                <pb facs="1071" n="967" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg967"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1215/417.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-01">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 1, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In pursuance of Department’s telegram of March 26, I had a conference today with
                    the President and the Minister for Foreign Affairs, both of whom agreed with me
                    that Mr. Calero should carry to Washington full instructions and should
                    immediately take up the discussion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
